        "title": "The diagram shows a process of making a storage area from a material called concrete canvas. Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and making comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><em><strong>The diagram shows a process of making a storage area from a material called concrete canvas. </strong></em></span><em style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarise the information by selecting and reporting the main features, and making comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Storage Area Construction with Concrete Canvas</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Storage Area Construction with Concrete Canvas y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả quy tr&igrave;nh tạo ra một khu vực lưu trữ bằng vật liệu c&oacute; t&ecirc;n l&agrave; <strong>concrete canvas</strong><em> (vải bạt b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng)</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-StR3d6EVgoRfGgx1yHAlizUJgpf\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Storage Area Construction with Concrete Canvas với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: quy tr&igrave;nh tạo ra một khu vực lưu trữ bằng vật liệu gọi l&agrave; bạt b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-URUgdOFlfoTLuOx4fhol6qV1gQ3\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UKHSdWxxroNK7Nx2f1zl4qLggqe\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M0wrdQvIaofgXrxTtDclfhevgLe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Nh&igrave;n chung, quy tr&igrave;nh gồm t&aacute;m giai đoạn để tạo ra một <strong>khu vực lưu trữ</strong><em><strong> </strong></em><em>(storage area)</em> từ bạt b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G4MGdfndioHzDFx5PH8lBZa9gtr\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Quy tr&igrave;nh bắt đầu với việc sản xuất bạt b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng, bao gồm c&aacute;c bước vận chuyển v&agrave; <strong>lắp đặt</strong> <em>(istallation)</em>, v&agrave; kết th&uacute;c với <strong>một cơ sở lưu trữ ho&agrave;n chỉnh</strong><em> (functional storage facility)</em>, sẵn s&agrave;ng đưa v&agrave;o sử dụng.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch m&ocirc; tả c&aacute;c đặc điểm của từng c&ocirc;ng đoạn.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BgHSd2dTeomakhx6OoxlhVwogvg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> &nbsp;</strong><strong>4 bước đầu trong c&ocirc;ng đoạn, bắt đầu từ giai đoạn sản xuất concrete canvas.</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RAFrds4TtoPHPjxh4OnlHmgUg8c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ej3Pd6xUEo9x8hxlhXhl4RCQgHd\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WFUXdfTz2oLTTXx7VJAl2z5Ngzh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Quy tr&igrave;nh được <strong>khởi đầu bằng giai đoạn sản xuất </strong><em>(commences with manufacturing),</em> trong đ&oacute; bạt b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng được tạo từ ba lớp:<strong> bề mặt sợi ở tr&ecirc;n </strong><em>(a fibrous top surface),</em> b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng kh&ocirc;, v&agrave; <strong>lớp chống thấm nước</strong><em> (waterproof)</em> ở ph&iacute;a dưới.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Of1PdQDcBoVISIxvZJilT9Aygn8\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>vật liệu được vận chuyển đến <strong>c&ocirc;ng trường</strong> <em>(construction site)</em> bằng xe tải, c&oacute; phủ bạt để tr&aacute;nh bụi.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PaNsddfJ9oaJLMxVAuXlrOi1g0g\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>bạt b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng được <strong>th&aacute;o ra khỏi bao b&igrave;</strong> <em>(unwrapped) </em>v&agrave; chuẩn bị cho<strong> quy tr&igrave;nh lắp đặt</strong> <em>(installation)</em>.Tiếp đ&oacute;, bạt được trải phẳng tr&ecirc;n mặt đất tạo th&agrave;nh <strong>mặt phẳng</strong><em> (a flat surface</em>) với chiều d&agrave;i khoảng 10 m&eacute;t, d&ugrave;ng <strong>cọc v&agrave; d&acirc;y</strong><em> (pegs and ropes)</em> để cố định<strong> độ ổn định</strong><em> (stability).</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;<strong>BODY</strong></span><strong>&nbsp;2</strong><strong>: </strong><strong>C&aacute;c bước c&ograve;n lại trong c&ocirc;ng đoạn, quy tr&igrave;nh tạo th&agrave;nh nơi lưu trữ. </strong><em>(storage unit)</em></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GgqddxwTioXRikxTqGwlmigPgNx\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GgqddxwTioXRikxTqGwlmigPgNx\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở Body 2 như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZmVadu54KoRo7mxvtRGlcKu2gVg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Sau khi <strong>thiết lập ban đầu </strong><em>(initial setup)</em>, kh&ocirc;ng kh&iacute; <strong>được bơm v&agrave;o</strong> <em>(is pumped into) </em>th&ocirc;ng qua một <strong>cơ chế cửa</strong> <em>(door mechanism)</em>, khiến vật liệu <strong>phồng l&ecirc;n </strong><em>(inflate)</em> v&agrave; tạo h&igrave;nh dạng của <strong>một đơn vị lưu trữ</strong><em> (storage unit). </em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AkA3dGZPhoaO3kx9wgQl1DyVglH\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>tưới nước to&agrave;n bộ bề mặt, gi&uacute;p<strong> k&iacute;ch hoạt </strong><em>(activates) </em>b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng b&ecirc;n trong lớp canvas. C&ocirc;ng tr&igrave;nh sau đ&oacute; cần thời gian đ&ocirc;ng kết từ 20 đến 24 tiếng để b&ecirc; t&ocirc;ng cứng lại v&agrave;<strong> trở n&ecirc;n vững chắc</strong> <em>(solidify).</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Sr2MdA1FUoyvPKxkiaslrxTLgtf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">khi<strong> qu&aacute; tr&igrave;nh đ&ocirc;ng kết </strong><em>(setting process) </em>ho&agrave;n tất, khu vực lưu trữ l&agrave;m từ concrete canvas sẵn s&agrave;ng sử dụng, c&oacute; thể <strong>đ&aacute;p ứng</strong> <em>(accommodate) </em>nhiều nhu cầu lưu trữ kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
